                                "sense_id": "8842ad20-a497-37fb-9f3d-4bee27c4e585",
                                "text": "Thus stode I in the frytthy forest of Galtres, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "33cc5cb4-400e-4080-9cba-032fefd24de7",
                                "sense_id": "8842ad20-a497-37fb-9f3d-4bee27c4e585",
                                "text": "Wild echoes scream, impetuous torrents roar, And mists and glooms obscure the frithy shore."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "20f792a8-92fe-45dc-97a6-042badb09e04",
                                "sense_id": "8842ad20-a497-37fb-9f3d-4bee27c4e585",
                                "text": "to complete their ingratitude and injustice, they transported a cargo of notorious traitors to the Divine Majesty among you, impiously calling the frithy lumber, Ministers of God's Word."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "04754fc6-e4d1-4712-938a-46f8e0908c62",
                                "sense_id": "8842ad20-a497-37fb-9f3d-4bee27c4e585",
                                "text": "In north India, small round, oblong or long, temperate varieties of radish may also be grown, but these should be harvested within 25-30 days, otherwise they become frithy very soon."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f70f86b-f3b1-4dc4-88ff-cd349330a258",
                                "sense_id": "8842ad20-a497-37fb-9f3d-4bee27c4e585",
                                "text": "\"Well,\" he met the Choco's glare, \"we can't very well have him looking like some frithy trail wanderer out for a lowsun stroll, that looks bad on us.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f6f1883-a0b3-43a4-bba4-6a5bc3bdb83e",
